\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Kimodo-Policy architecture.} Colored blocks: \inlinecolorblock  {green!55!black}{green!15} Kimodo denoisers, \inlinecolorblock  {blue!55!black}{blue!10} DINOv3-conditioned~\citep  {dinov3} ControlNet, and \inlinecolorblock  {gray!65}{gray!15} HandNet. Dashed boxes show Dual-Path Fusion: motion-query cross-attention and spatial-to-temporal MLPs. Root predictions condition body generation; future body features guide bilateral hand control. The Motion Projector maps root--body outputs to tracker references. Snowflakes/flames mark frozen/trainable modules.}}{4}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:method_architecture}{{3}{4}{\textbf {Kimodo-Policy architecture.} Colored blocks: \inlinecolorblock {green!55!black}{green!15} Kimodo denoisers, \inlinecolorblock {blue!55!black}{blue!10} DINOv3-conditioned~\cite {dinov3} ControlNet, and \inlinecolorblock {gray!65}{gray!15} HandNet. Dashed boxes show Dual-Path Fusion: motion-query cross-attention and spatial-to-temporal MLPs. Root predictions condition body generation; future body features guide bilateral hand control. The Motion Projector maps root--body outputs to tracker references. Snowflakes/flames mark frozen/trainable modules}{figure.3}{}}
